{
  "_comment": "Golden cases for instance derivation. crates/server/src/instance.rs, scripts/setup-wda.sh and uninstall.sh must agree on every row (#67); scripts/test-instance-context.sh checks the shell side. state_dir_override must be absolute, free of . and .., not / or HOME, and neither equal to, inside, nor an ancestor of ~/.iphone-use; on-disk it must be a real directory (no symlink) owned by HOME's owner.",
