  "port_derivation": {
    "_comment": "Shell-only (setup-wda.sh instance-context; install.sh persists the result). The default instance keeps 44321/8100/9100. A named instance's first-choice slot is cksum(name) % slots added to each base; a slot whose ports another instance's plist claims, or that something listens on, is skipped for the next one. Ports already persisted in the instance's plists always win.",
